            >🔄 Switch hands for the next round</span
          >
          <span class="pill pill-yt">😤 No complaining for 30 minutes</span>
          <span class="pill pill-twitch"
            >🎵 Explain everything through song</span
          >
          <span class="pill pill-gold">💬 Chat decides the next loadout</span>
        </div>

        <!-- ═══ SECTION 5 ═══ -->
        <h2 id="charity">5. Charity Milestone Wheels That Drive Donations</h2>
        <div class="platform-badge badge-twitch">💜 Charity Streams</div>

        <p>
          Charity wheels work differently from other creator formats because the
          wheel itself becomes the incentive — people donate to make it spin,
          not only to support the cause. That alignment between entertainment
          and fundraising mechanics is why milestone-based wheels consistently
          pull in more than a plain donation appeal on its own.
        </p>

        <h3>Building a tiered milestone structure</h3>
        <p>
          Arrange segments by donation tier, with each one tied to a specific
          threshold. As the total climbs past each milestone, a new spin
          unlocks. Keep the current total and the next target visible on screen
          at all times — donors need to see exactly how close they are to
          triggering the next spin.
        </p>

